<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Suncrush to unbundle Tempora, Ettington.</title>
<headline>Suncrush to unbundle Tempora, Ettington.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Soft drink bottler Suncrush Ltd said on Tuesday it would distribute to shareholders its 49.8 percent shareholding in Tempora Investments Ltd and its 79.4 percent stake in Ettington Investments Ltd.  </p>
<p>The market value of the holdings as of Monday's close was 619 million rand and 143 million rand respectively. Suncrush's market capitalisation was 1.93 billion rand.</p>
</text>
